direction: right
Batch: Batch sources {shape: cylinder}
Streams: Streaming sources {shape: queue}
Ingestion: Unified ingestion {shape: rectangle}
ObjectStore: Object storage {shape: stored_data}
Tables: Open table format {shape: document}
Catalog: Metadata catalog {shape: rectangle}
SQL: SQL engine {shape: rectangle}
ML: ML training {shape: rectangle}
BI: BI tools {shape: page}
Batch -> Ingestion
Streams -> Ingestion
Ingestion -> ObjectStore
Tables -> ObjectStore
Catalog -> Tables
SQL -> Catalog
ML -> Catalog
SQL -> BI
ObjectStore -> SQL
ObjectStore -> ML
